  "description": "Schema validation for .xlsx worksheets. Declare the columns you expect and the type each one holds, then validate a workbook and get back a structured list of errors with cell addresses — or an annotated copy of the workbook with the bad cells highlighted. Built on ClosedXML, so there is no commercial licensing restriction.",
